## Example

# Compared e.g. to `list.btp`, here we can construct `S(NIL)` (term)
termNil : rTmS x=tmNil!
# But we cannot construct N(S(NIL)) (theorem), since `rThmS x=tmNil!` requires N(NIL) which is not derivable

term1 : rTmS x=tm0!
theorem1 : rThmS x=tm0! thmZ!
